### Health check
GET http://localhost:3210/health

### Create session
POST http://localhost:3210/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"repo_id": "demo"}

### Onboard repo
POST http://localhost:3210/context/repos/demo/onboard

### Write memory
POST http://localhost:3210/memory/write
Content-Type: application/json

{"scope": "repo", "scope_id": "demo", "content": "Always run tests before committing", "metadata": {"source": "convention"}}

### Classify task
POST http://localhost:3210/classify/task
Content-Type: application/json

{"prompt": "Fix a failing login test", "repo_id": "demo"}

### Search memory
POST http://localhost:3210/memory/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"query": "tests", "scope": "repo", "limit": 10}

### Allowed next actions
POST http://localhost:3210/rules/allowed-next-actions
Content-Type: application/json

{"task_type": "code_edit", "current_action": "classify_task"}

### Execute action — read_file
POST http://localhost:3210/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{"action_name": "read_file", "params": {"path": "src/auth.ts"}}

### Execute action — grep
POST http://localhost:3210/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{"action_name": "grep", "params": {"pattern": "login"}}

### Execute action — run_tests
POST http://localhost:3210/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{"action_name": "run_tests", "params": {}}

### Record trace
POST http://localhost:3210/traces/tool-call
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id": "REPLACE_SESSION_ID", "action_name": "read_file", "input": {"path": "src/auth.ts"}, "output": {"content": "..."}, "duration_ms": 42}

### Extract memories
POST http://localhost:3210/memory/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id": "REPLACE_SESSION_ID", "text": "We should always validate input. The auth module requires rate limiting."}

### Mock platform — policy check
POST http://localhost:3210/mock-platform/policy/check
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id": "REPLACE_SESSION_ID", "action_name": "commit"}

### Get session timeline
GET http://localhost:3210/sessions/REPLACE_SESSION_ID/timeline

### List actions
GET http://localhost:3210/actions
